   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Specifies a Service Version. The exact type may be overridden by the Communication Management software provider. but shall at least satisfy the [equalitycomparable] (<a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CM_11516\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_CM_11516]</a>), [lessthancomparable] (<a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CM_11517\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_CM_11517]</a>) and [copyassignable] (<a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CM_11518\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_CommunicationManagement.pdf)\">[SWS_CM_11518]</a>) requirements as per <a class=\"bibref\" href=\"https://www.iso.org\" title=\"ISO/IEC 14882:2014, Information technology – Programming languages – C++\">[30]</a> to allow for logging, storing and managing ara:: com::ServiceVersionTypes by the application.</p><p class=\"fnote\">Literaturverzeichnis SWS CommunicationManagement: <span id=\"fn-head-30\">[30] ISO/IEC 14882:2014, Information technology – Programming languages – C++ – <a href=\"https://www.iso.org\">www.iso.org</a></span></p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
